Package: oostrings
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: BINARY EXTRACTOR
 Scans binary binaries and memory dumps for printable UTF-8 and ASCII sequences.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
